    "version": "1.0.0",
    "title": "Rider Privacy Notice cum Consent",
    "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  <title>Rider Privacy Notice and Consent</title>\n  <style>\n    :root { color-scheme: light; --text: #11202f; --secondary: #5b6b7c; --muted: #8b9aaa; --accent: #f475d0; --wash: #fdecf8; --ink: #3d0a2c; }\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html { -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }\n    body { margin: 0; background: #fff; color: var(--secondary); font: 15px/1.6 -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, \"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, sans-serif; }\n    main { width: 100%; max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 18px 28px; }\n    .hero { margin-bottom: 16px; }\n    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--accent); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }\n    h1 { margin: 0 0 6px; color: var(--text); font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.3; }\n    h2 { margin: 26px 0 8px; color: var(--text); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.35; }\n    p, ul { margin: 0 0 13px; }\n    ul { padding-left: 20px; }\n    li { margin-bottom: 6px; }\n    strong { color: var(--text); }\n    .muted { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }\n    a { color: #b63891; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }\n    .callout { margin-top: 24px; padding: 12px 14px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--wash); color: var(--ink); }\n    .callout h2 { margin-top: 0; }\n    @media (max-width: 380px) { main { padding: 16px 14px 24px; } }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <header class=\"hero\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Before you continue</p>\n    <h1>Rider Privacy Notice cum Consent</h1>\n    <p>Consent for collection of personal data under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act 2023.</p>\n    <p class=\"muted\">[CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm the data fiduciary, DPO contact, each data category, source and sharing purpose before publishing.]</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"purpose\">\n    <h2 id=\"purpose\">Purpose of data collection</h2>\n    <p>To onboard riders on the platform of {{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} to avail its services and to facilitate subsequent transactions.</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"details\">\n    <h2 id=\"details\">Types of data collected</h2>\n    <p>{{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} will collect the following personal data:</p>\n    <ul>\n      <li>Identification information (PAN, name, and date of birth).</li>\n      <li>One proof of address (Aadhaar, driving licence, or another officially valid document).</li>\n      <li>Contact information (email address and phone number).</li>\n      <li>Financial information (bank information, upi information, passbook, or income statement), if applicable. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm whether this is collected.]</li>\n      </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"sources\">\n    <h2 id=\"sources\">Sources of data collection</h2>\n    <ul>\n      <li>NSDL. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verify that NSDL is a live source.]</li>\n      <li>Databases maintained by government, statutory or regulatory authorities. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: identify applicable sources.]</li>\n      <li>The onboarding entity or user.</li>\n    </ul>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"sharing\">\n    <h2 id=\"sharing\">Data sharing</h2>\n    <p>{{CLIENT_LEGAL_NAME}} is authorised to share data with statutory, regulatory and government authorities; service providers engaged for business and operational purposes; and parties involved in facilitating services provided by the company. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: confirm the recipients, purposes and legal basis for each category.]</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"card\" aria-labelledby=\"choice\">\n    <h2 id=\"choice\">Rights of the data principal</h2>\n    <p>You may request correction, completion, updating and erasure of personal data processed with your consent, and withdraw consent at any time. To exercise these rights, contact the company at [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: insert the verified DPO or grievance email].</p>\n    <p>Notwithstanding a request to withdraw consent, the company may retain data for periods prescribed by applicable law and for transactions initiated before withdrawal. For a complaint or grievance, contact [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verified grievance contact]. An unresolved complaint may be escalated to the Data Protection Board in accordance with applicable law. [CLIENT_REVIEW_REQUIRED: verify the source form's 90-day escalation wording before publication.]</p>\n  </section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
